# HAPI FHIR (R4) requests for the REST Client extension. HAPI has no authentication of its
# own: it is only reachable from this machine and the `api` app is the only intended client.

@fhir = http://localhost:8090/fhir

### Capability statement (fhirVersion must be 4.0.1)
GET {{fhir}}/metadata
Accept: application/fhir+json

### Create or replace a scratch Patient with a client-assigned id
PUT {{fhir}}/Patient/pt-scratch
Content-Type: application/fhir+json

{
  "resourceType": "Patient",
  "id": "pt-scratch",
  "name": [{ "family": "Scratch", "given": ["Test"] }],
  "gender": "other",
  "birthDate": "1990-01-01"
}

### Read it back
GET {{fhir}}/Patient/pt-scratch
Accept: application/fhir+json

### Search
GET {{fhir}}/Patient?family=Scratch
Accept: application/fhir+json

### Validate a resource against the base R4 profile
POST {{fhir}}/Patient/$validate
Content-Type: application/fhir+json

{
  "resourceType": "Patient",
  "gender": "not-a-gender"
}

### Clean up
DELETE {{fhir}}/Patient/pt-scratch

# --- Demo cohort (run `bb seed` first) ---------------------------------------

### Dr. Rivera's patient panel
GET {{fhir}}/Patient?general-practitioner=Practitioner/pr-rivera
Accept: application/fhir+json
Cache-Control: no-cache

### Ana's latest blood pressure panels (newest first)
GET {{fhir}}/Observation?patient=Patient/pt-ana&code=http://loinc.org|85354-9&_sort=-date&_count=5
Accept: application/fhir+json
Cache-Control: no-cache

### Maya's weight over time (heart-failure scenario)
GET {{fhir}}/Observation?patient=Patient/pt-maya&code=http://loinc.org|29463-7&_sort=date
Accept: application/fhir+json
Cache-Control: no-cache

### Everything about one patient, in a single request
GET {{fhir}}/Patient/pt-sofia/$everything
Accept: application/fhir+json

### Appointments that are only proposed (asked for by the patient)
GET {{fhir}}/Appointment?status=proposed
Accept: application/fhir+json
